# Edge Functions — LOCAL development secrets only.
#
# Copy to `supabase/functions/.env` (gitignored) for `supabase functions serve`.
# Production secrets live in Supabase (`supabase secrets set`), never here.
# revoke-apple needs: APPLE_TEAM_ID, APPLE_KEY_ID, APPLE_CLIENT_ID, APPLE_PRIVATE_KEY.
#
# ⚠️ Do NOT set any SUPABASE_-prefixed variables here.
#    SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
#    SUPABASE_DB_URL, etc. are RESERVED and auto-injected into the function
#    runtime by Supabase. Setting them here is ignored at best and conflicting
#    at worst. Use your own, unprefixed names for custom secrets.
#
# Example (custom secret, not SUPABASE_-prefixed):
# PILTOVER_ARCHIVE_BASE_URL=https://example.com
